      "body": "Add a public event-bus delegation bridge for Rodrigo's Pi Agent Switcher. Manually addressed tasks use the same existing subagent lifecycle, project-agent confirmation, progress cards, completion results and cancellation.\n\nThe bridge adds no second subagent engine and leaves `/run` and the existing tools available. Integration channel: `rodrigojager:pi-subagent:delegate:v1`.\n\nValidation: Bun check, full verify (1,843 tests passed, zero failures) and a 47-file package smoke check. The compatible selector also passed an end-to-end Pi SDK test with a real offline child process.\n\nThe attached archive contains the runtime package. Reload an already-running Pi only after active work finishes.\n"
    },
